# AGENTS.md — `assets/figures/`

Root [`../../AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) applies. This directory contains
human-authored, non-regenerable source assets.

- Do not overwrite, flatten, or discard editable source.
- Do not invent creator, license, tool, date, or external-source metadata.
- Do not place code-generated plots here to get them into Git; generated figures
  remain ignored under `results/figures/`.
- New or materially revised authored assets require human review. Keep files at
  or below 1 MiB in Git; use {{ data_versioning }} for larger/frequently changing
  binaries at the same logical path.
